# Text files are stored with LF in the repository regardless of the platform they
# were authored on. Without this, a contributor whose `core.autocrlf` differs can
# commit CRLF blobs, and `format:check` then fails in CI for everyone.
* text=auto

# Never touched by line-ending conversion.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
